# Vault

Vault is an AI-powered student finance platform built on Sui. It helps students manage allowances, stipends, and daily spending through enforceable onchain budget vaults, category-based spending rules, flexible category swaps, overspending controls, and long-term financial memory powered offchain by Walrus and MemWal.

Unlike a traditional budgeting app that only records expenses after they happen, Vault enforces budget rules directly onchain. Students deposit SUI into a budget vault, allocate that balance across spending categories, and make tracked payments from the vault. The contract records events that an offchain AI/indexer layer can persist to Walrus and MemWal for personalized financial guidance over time.

